  "expertText": "* = $0801\n; INCLUDE demo — includes bitmap macros from include-library.json\n; The INCLUDE block below loads include-library.json (BitmapOn, BitmapOff, HiresClearScreen, WaitForKey)\n    SEI\n; Enable hires bitmap mode, clear screen, wait for key, then disable\n    JSR $E544\n.invoke StartScreen\n.invoke WaitForKey\n.invoke BitmapOn\n.invoke HiresClearScreen\n.invoke WaitForKey\n.invoke BitmapOff\n    RTS\n.include \"macros\", $1500\n.macro StartScreen\n    JSR $E544\n.text 1, 1, \"hires-on\"\n.text 1, 2, \"clear screen and clear color ram\"\n.text 1, 3, \"press key and then press key again!\"\n.endm",
